      @contract  constructs the substack (am local, only av leaves); the renderer is handed av, never am  @ 9
      @contract  arrange is project-wide — bind() takes no take and never re-keys cm  @ 10
      @contract  render hooks delegate to arrangeRender; seedCursor drive av directly  @ 11

